{"h":3106,"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11278195699055982,"x":0.78195488605195773,"y":0.078488372277159213,"h":0.014534883321060788},{"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","y":0.12645348858160177,"w":0.61090225219726557,"c":1,"h":0.015988371407532842,"x":0.093984959756630432},{"w":0.77067667643229165,"y":0.16569767428636417,"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading Answer Key you will find a chart which will help","h":0.017496144011645454,"c":1,"x":0.090225571395916221},{"h":0.020405018321944302,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your Practice Test results, you are ready to take the","y":0.18361847941632137,"c":1,"x":0.090159233564239688,"w":0.76140874226888022},{"w":0.097841218312581371,"t":"IELTS test.","h":0.016345199737254013,"c":1,"x":0.090177135116784699,"y":0.20330995794642104},{"h":0.020086313015556523,"c":1,"w":0.74069371541341145,"x":0.10897191864742486,"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your","y":0.22086162979902135},{"c":1,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","x":0.092105254073935799,"h":0.016121273568884709,"y":0.24114616856081661,"w":0.78195490519205735},{"x":0.090092946906202176,"w":0.73708867390950517,"h":0.022121051166875794,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which","y":0.25588026781908202,"c":1},{"h":0.017530773504273123,"t":"is the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering","y":0.27752736615620366,"x":0.088345874525612753,"c":1,"w":0.75187967936197919},{"h":0.017332906041387819,"t":"your application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Bands for","c":1,"x":0.09017744293174132,"w":0.74068852742513014,"y":0.29518961922500808},{"w":0.76879699707031246,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703185,"t":"each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed for a","y":0.31540697647071425,"x":0.092105260769354991},{"t":"particular course of study. For example, if your course involves a lot of reading and writing,","w":0.78383458455403643,"x":0.09022556464654069,"y":0.33284883721458558,"h":0.01905071175029327,"c":1},{"x":0.090225582096782275,"w":0.7951127624511718,"h":0.017541068028574802,"c":1,"y":0.35174418631404403,"t":"but no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening might be"},{"w":0.79887217203776029,"h":0.017508310881723332,"t":"acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots of lectures","x":0.090225568006401413,"y":0.37057308459240135,"c":1},{"y":0.389534883447481,"c":1,"w":0.77067667643229165,"x":0.090225571462569487,"h":0.016131568707271393,"t":"and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even though the"},{"t":"Overall Band Score was 7.","c":1,"h":0.020494103661983565,"y":0.40404722548083061,"w":0.23553250630696609,"x":0.090003127970840757},{"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening","c":1,"x":0.1127819591589604,"y":0.42587209303436646,"w":0.75563908894856779,"h":0.018895348808647294},{"w":0.76701024373372395,"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","c":1,"y":0.4434528311082897,"h":0.018856210702477449,"x":0.090175823495223989},{"w":0.79511276245117191,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are ready","x":0.090225573553304059,"h":0.018995492594977459,"y":0.46361880255707766,"c":1},{"t":"to take the test.","y":0.48255813972428596,"w":0.13721804300944013,"h":0.014544242593601986,"x":0.088345865616615907,"c":1},{"y":0.4995206819298863,"w":0.77079661051432291,"t":"The Practice Tests have been checked to ensure that they are of approximately the same","h":0.018689092327837664,"x":0.11083498316051475,"c":1},{"h":0.021378708131376323,"w":0.80089935302734361,"c":1,"x":0.086383997376699523,"y":0.51770103768398945,"t":"level of difficulty as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the"},{"x":0.090225560366042803,"h":0.016110042564652427,"t":"Practice Tests will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The Practice Tests can only give you","w":0.77819549560546886,"c":1,"y":0.53766902747202561},{"x":0.088290593425737807,"h":0.019397925962115314,"w":0.78583597819010431,"t":"an idea of your possible future performance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions","y":0.55529274857032362,"c":1},{"h":0.019204081371378634,"c":1,"t":"based on your score.","y":0.57440587345451666,"w":0.18689715067545573,"x":0.087952687386033596},{"x":0.11082841370274972,"w":0.76893783569335938,"h":0.018953163088020419,"c":1,"y":0.59220678999871457,"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We have"},{"x":0.088302708540169209,"y":0.6118976582254736,"h":0.018262912285995636,"t":"based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions accept.","w":0.79520121256510423,"c":1},{"t":"The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower score than","x":0.088286881362334577,"y":0.63031848184011396,"w":0.7989798482259115,"h":0.019428512317782753,"c":1},{"t":"most other institutions.","x":0.088345866712287488,"y":0.64810045087120038,"h":0.017707662588538287,"c":1,"w":0.20112781524658202},{"t":"Further information","w":0.20864662170410156,"y":0.67868641352629766,"h":0.018995492594977459,"x":0.090225561220564993,"c":1},{"t":"For more information about IELTS or any other Cambridge English Language Assessment","x":0.088274466761324763,"y":0.705382738501099,"w":0.78207260131835932,"h":0.019842287838574224,"c":1},{"w":0.18871452331542965,"h":0.022868387943225987,"t":"examination, write to:","c":1,"x":0.087991958812724633,"y":0.72255027770573466},{"x":0.088345859587732986,"h":0.020381594656055713,"t":"Cambridge English Language Assessment","w":0.3740601603190104,"y":0.76014166099512215,"c":1},{"x":0.08823317369330326,"c":1,"t":"1 Hills Road","h":0.019700321165577295,"w":0.1111276372273763,"y":0.77721379274938107},{"x":0.090091968786728649,"w":0.09801155090332031,"y":0.79754430947444921,"h":0.019736962401321945,"c":1,"t":"Cambridge"},{"y":0.81645322992616265,"c":1,"x":0.088222595424504918,"t":"CB1 2EU","w":0.086712703704833971,"h":0.0168028424343446},{"c":1,"t":"United Kingdom","x":0.088345867181993096,"w":0.14473683675130206,"h":0.019005787733364143,"y":0.83419188660797505},{"h":0.018895348808647183,"t":"https:\/\/support.cambridgeenglish.org","x":0.088345863696630056,"y":0.8720930232638382,"w":0.31954887390136716,"c":1},{"y":0.88895436823081542,"c":1,"t":"http:\/\/www.ielts.org","w":0.16972750345865886,"h":0.021064728824691681,"x":0.086217783811221166},{"t":"a","c":1,"x":0.8759398495928169,"h":0.010174418447559619,"w":0.013157894611358634,"y":0.98837209300005735}]}